<h2>Centrally Pinned Dependency Matrix</h2>
<p>
  Per <a href="/adr/0002-cli-framework-and-package-policy/">ADR 0002</a>, every direct NuGet dependency is pinned in <code>Directory.Packages.props</code> with <code>CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled=true</code> and verified via locked restore (<code>packages.lock.json</code>). The table below is generated directly from <code>Directory.Packages.props</code>:
</p>

<div class="flux-table-wrap" data-component="spec-table">
  <div class="flux-table-wrap__header">
    <span class="flux-glyph" aria-hidden="true">■</span>
    <span>CENTRALLY PINNED PACKAGES (GENERATED FROM Directory.Packages.props)</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flux-table-scroll">
    <table class="flux-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Package Identifier</th>
          <th scope="col">Pinned Version</th>
          <th scope="col">Architectural Role</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for pkg in generated.packages %}
          <tr>
            <td><code>{{ pkg.name }}</code></td>
            <td><code>{{ pkg.version }}</code></td>
            <td>
              {% if pkg.name == 'System.CommandLine' %}
                Command, option, and argument parsing in <code>FluxEncoder.Cli</code> (trimming &amp; NativeAOT safe).
              {% elseif pkg.name == 'Spectre.Console' %}
                Terminal rendering (tables, progress bars, markup) in <code>FluxEncoder.Cli</code>.
              {% elseif pkg.name == 'Microsoft.Data.Sqlite' %}
                Local WAL execution history and telemetry storage in <code>FluxEncoder.Infrastructure</code>.
              {% elseif pkg.name == 'YamlDotNet' %}
                Low-level event-stream parser and emitter for <code>Fluxfile.yaml</code> and YAML exports.
              {% elseif pkg.name == 'xunit.v3' %}
                Self-hosting test executables running on <code>Microsoft.Testing.Platform</code>.
              {% else %}
                Pinned project dependency.
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
